no="Best match per slot for Demonology by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"warlock-g239","warlock-g249","warlock-g10","warlock-g15","warlock-g233","warlock-g248","warlock-g198","warlock-g126","warlock-g208","warlock-g231","warlock-g84","warlock-g90","warlock-g218","warlock-g246","warlock-g234","warlock-g30"}},{b="30-39",no="Best match per slot for Demonology by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"warlock-g295","warlock-g62","warlock-g251","warlock-g280","warlock-g267","warlock-g6","warlock-g292","warlock-g283","warlock-g293","warlock-g128","warlock-g88","warlock-g279","warlock-g117","warlock-g266","warlock-g297"}},{b="40-49",no="Best match per slot for Demonology by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"warlock-g319","warlock-g307","warlock-g332","warlock-g335","warlock-g299","warlock-g35","warlock-g323","warlock-g324","warlock-g304","warlock-g45","warlock-g348","warlock-g321","warlock-g345","warlock-g111","warlock-g327"}},{b="50-60",no="Best match per slot for Demonology by stat priority, picked from dungeon drops, quest rewards and crafting at this level range. Quest and crafted pieces are listed in the sections below.",keys={"warlock-g368","warlock-g2","warlock-g392","warlock-g102","warlock-g414","warlock-g92","warlock-g383","warlock-g406","warlock-g436","warlock-g373","warlock-g441","warlock-g384","warlock-g376","warlock-g0","warlock-g404","warlock-g430","warlock-g428","warlock-g423"}}},title="Demonology | WoW Forever Warlock Field Guide",nav={{id="overview",x=S[545]},{id="journey",x=S[421]},{id="talents",x=S[366]},{id="stats",x=S[455]},{id="combat",x=S[456]},{id="macros",x=S[442]},{id="dungeons",x=S[393]},{id="professions",x=S[422]},{id="crafting",x=S[408]},{id="questgear",x=S[384]},{id=S[364],x=S[502]}},asideNote=S[73],talentString="0200000000000000000050032312203013510550005003",ranks={{tree="Affliction",name="Suppression",r=2,max=5},{tree="Demonology",name=S[624],r=5,max=5},{tree="Demonology",name=S[385],r=3,max=3},{tree="Demonology",name=S[595],r=2,max=2},{tree="Demonology",name=S[507],r=3,max=3},{tree="Demonology",name=S[286],r=1,max=1},{tree="Demonology",name=S[602],r=2,max=2},{tree="Demonology",name="Decimation",r=2,max=2},{tree="Demonology",name=S[617],r=3,max=3},{tree="Demonology",name="Soul Link",r=1,max=1},{tree="Demonology",name=S[590],r=3,max=3},{tree="Demonology",name=S[554],r=5,max=5},{tree="Demonology",name=S[625],r=1,max=1},{tree="Destruction",name=S[369],r=5,max=5},{tree="Destruction",name="Bane",r=5,max=5},{tree="Destruction",name="Ruin",r=5,max=5},{tree="Destruction",name=S[417],r=3,max=3}},order={{l1=10,l2=14,tree="Demonology",name=S[624],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=15,l2=17,tree="Demonology",name=S[385],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=18,l2=19,tree="Demonology",name=S[595],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=20,l2=20,tree="Demonology",name=S[286],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=21,l2=22,tree="Demonology",name=S[602],r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=23,l2=24,tree="Demonology",name=S[507],r1=1,r2=2,max=3},{l1=25,l2=26,tree="Demonology",name="Decimation",r1=1,r2=2,max=2},{l1=27,l2=29,tree="Demonology",name=S[617],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=30,l2=30,tree="Demonology",name="Soul Link",r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=31,l2=33,tree="Demonology",name=S[590],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=34,l2=34,tree="Demonology",name=S[507],r1=3,r2=3,max=3},{l1=35,l2=39,tree="Demonology",name=S[554],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=40,l2=40,tree="Demonology",name=S[625],r1=1,r2=1,max=1},{l1=41,l2=45,tree="Destruction",name="Bane",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=46,l2=50,tree="Destruction",name=S[369],r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=51,l2=55,tree="Destruction",name="Ruin",r1=1,r2=5,max=5},{l1=56,l2=58,tree="Destruction",name=S[417],r1=1,r2=3,max=3},{l1=59,l2=60,tree="Affliction",name="Suppression",r1=1,r2=2,max=5}},blocks={{t="anchor",id="overview"},{t="p",s="eyebrow",x=S[386]},{t="h1",x="Demonology",sub=S[443]},{t="p",s="lede",x="Sacrifice your Imp for Shadow damage, keep that bonus with Demonic Pact while your Succubus fights beside you, and spam Shadow Bolt behind your curse and dots, with Soul Fire as an execute."},{t="pills",list={S[500],S[423]}},{t="anchor",id="journey"},{t="kicker",x=S[546]},{t="h2",x=S[329]},{t="p",x="These stages describe a practical route toward your chosen level-60 endpoint. The sacrifice-and-Pact setup only comes together at 40, so the early levels play like a normal pet Warlock."},{t="p",s="level",x="1–19 · Learn the basics with a pet"},{t="p",x="Corruption, Bane of Agony, Immolate and Shadow Bolt carry you early. Unholy Power, Fel Vitality and Demonic Energies make your Imp or Voidwalker hit harder and live longer, which keeps downtime short."},{t="p",s="level",x="20–39 · Sacrifice and summoning"},{t="p",x="Demonic Sacrifice arrives at 20. Before Demonic Pact, summoning any demon cancels the sacrifice, so choose between a living pet and the bonus. Master Summoner makes resummoning cheap and fast. Improved Sayaad strengthens the Succubus’s Lash of Pain, Decimation turns Shadow Bolts on low-health enemies into a cheap, fast Soul Fire, Demonic Brand lets a Searing Pain mark the target for extra demon damage, and Soul Link plus Demonic Knowledge strengthen you while a demon is out."},{t="p",s="level",x="40–60 · Pact, then Destruction"},{t="p",x="Demonic Pact completes the setup at 40: sacrifice the Imp for 15% Shadow damage, then summon the Succubus for Master Demonologist’s extra 10% Shadow damage without losing the sacrifice. The next 18 points go into Bane, Improved Shadow Bolt, Ruin and Agonizing Flames to make Shadow Bolt faster and its critical strikes bigger, and the last two buy Suppression for hit. Soul Fire is trained at 48 and becomes your execute with Decimation."},{t="anchor",id="talents"},{t="kicker",x=S[367]},{t="h2",x=S[500]},{t="p",x=S[47]},{t="widget",w="talents"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[394]},{t="widget",w="ranks"},{t="h4",s="summary",x=S[351]},{t="p",x=S[70]},{t="widget",w="order"},{t="p",s="notice",x="Demonic Sacrifice and Demonic Pact give Demonology strong baseline damage. Sacrifice the Imp (15% Shadow damage), then summon the Succubus; with Demonic Pact the sacrifice stays active, and Master Demonologist adds 10% Shadow damage while the Succubus is out. Resummoning an Imp cancels the sacrifice. Only 2/5 Suppression is taken, so this build gets 2% spell hit from talents."},{t="anchor",id="stats"},{t="kicker",x=S[457]},{t="h2",x=S[375]},{t="p",x="Demonology values hit the most of the Warlock specs: your demon uses your hit chance, so every miss you remove helps both of you. Your demon also scales with your spell power."},{t="h3",x=S[528]},{t="stat",i=1,b=S[571],x="match your build: Shadow or Fire"},{t="stat",i=2,b="Stamina",x=S[323]},{t="stat",i=3,b="Spirit",x="more from Life Tap"},{t="stat",i=4,b="Intellect",x="mana pool"},{t="p",s="small",x="Shadow or Fire damage on gear is worth much less to the other build, so match it to the school you cast."},{t="h3",x="At level 60"},{t="stat",i=1,b="Hit chance",x="to 17%"},{t="stat",i=2,b="Spell power",x="or your build’s school damage"},{t="stat",i=3,b=S[503],x=""},{t="stat",i=4,b="Haste",x=""},{t="stat",i=5,b="Intellect",x=""},{t="p",s="small",x="Each point in Suppression lowers the hit you need from gear by 1%. Your demon inherits your spell hit and part of it as melee hit."},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[48]},{t="anchor",id="combat"},{t="kicker",x=S[376]},{t="h2",x=S[409]},{t="p",x="Treat this as a priority guide, not a fixed loop. Before Demonic Pact at 40 and Soul Fire at 48, leave out the steps you have not unlocked."},{t="h4",x="Prepare the sacrifice"},{t="p",x="Out of combat, summon your Imp and use Demonic Sacrifice for 15% Shadow damage. Then summon your Succubus: Demonic Pact keeps the sacrifice active, Master Demonologist adds 10% Shadow damage for you both, and Soul Link and Demonic Knowledge stay up because a demon is out. Fel Domination is not in this build, so do this before the pull."},{t="h4",x="Curse and dots first"},{t="p",x="Apply your Curse (Curse of the Elements for dungeon bosses), Bane of Agony and Corruption on targets that will live long enough, then Immolate. In Forever a Bane and a Curse of yours can share a target."},{t="h4",x="Fill with Searing Pain"},{t="p",x="Shadow Bolt is your filler: it is Shadow, so the sacrifice and Succubus bonuses apply, Bane makes it faster and Ruin makes its critical strikes much bigger. Use Searing Pain when you want Demonic Brand on the target for extra demon damage, and watch threat on bosses all the same."},{t="h4",x="Execute with Soul Fire"},{t="p",x="Below 35% health, Shadow Bolt (or Searing Pain) triggers Decimation: for 10 seconds Soul Fire casts 40% faster and costs no Soul Shard, and Decimation already cuts Soul Fire’s cooldown by 90%. Spam Soul Fire through the execute phase and refresh Decimation with Shadow Bolt when it is about to expire."},{t="h4",x="Keep the Imp alive and fed"},{t="p",x="Soul Link sends 30% of your damage taken to the Succubus, and Demonic Energies heals it for part of your spell damage and gives it the mana from your Life Taps. If the Succubus dies, resummon it: the Pact keeps your sacrifice, but you lose the Succubus-based bonuses until it is back."},{t="h4",x="Packs and mana"},{t="p",x="Rain of Fire and Hellfire are Fire spells and benefit from the same bonuses. Life Tap scales with Spirit. Keep Fear and Death Coil ready for emergencies."},{t="abil",names={"Searing Pain","Soul Fire","Immolate","Corruption",S[616],S[424],S[286],"Summon Imp"}},{t="h3",x=S[482]},{t="p",x="Shadow spell damage and general spell power come first: Shadow Bolt, Corruption and Bane of Agony are all Shadow, and your sacrifice and Succubus bonuses multiply them. Fire damage only helps Immolate and Soul Fire. Intellect adds critical chance, which Ruin makes much more valuable. This build has 2% hit from talents, so hit on gear matters against bosses."},{t="p",x=S[54]},{t="h3",x=S[319]},{t="p",x="Keep Soul Shards for summoning the Imp to sacrifice, Healthstones and a Soulstone; Decimation makes Soul Fire free during the execute window. Create Spellstone (from 36) is a weapon imbue that adds Shadow damage and spell haste, which suits this build better than a Firestone."},{t="p",x="Your Succubus keeps Master Demonologist’s Shadow bonus active and adds Lash of Pain, which Improved Sayaad strengthens. Bring Curse of the Elements unless another Warlock already covers it."},{t="anchor",id="macros"},{t="kicker",x=S[444]},{t="h2",x=S[304]},{t="p",x=S[46]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[38]},{t="macro",n=S[395],x=S[62],code=S[141]},{t="macro",n=S[434],x=S[124],code=S[154]},{t="macro",n=S[334],x=S[65],code=S[113]},{t="macro",n=S[373],x=S[77],code=S[132]},{t="macro",n=S[529],x=S[97],code=S[181]},{t="macro",n=S[495],x=S[114],code=S[172]},{t="macro",n=S[377],x=S[112],code=S[120]},{t="macro",n=S[445],x=S[106],code=S[157]},{t="macro",n=S[435],x=S[100],code=S[155]},{t="macro",n=S[368],x=S[101],code=S[189]},{t="macro",n=S[504],x=S[144],code=S[246]},{t="macro",n=S[410],x=S[102],code=S[216]},{t="macro",n=S[572],x=S[201],code=S[335]},{t="macro",n="Sacrifice, then summon Succubus",x="With your Imp out, the first press sacrifices it. Press again with no pet to summon the Succubus, which keeps the sacrifice thanks to Demonic Pact.",code="#showtooltip Demonic Sacrifice\n/cast [pet:Imp] Demonic Sacrifice; [nopet] Summon Succubus"},{t="macro",n="Soul Fire / Shift Shadow Bolt",x="Normal press casts Soul Fire for the execute phase. Hold Shift for Shadow Bolt to trigger or refresh Decimation.",code="#showtooltip\n/cast [mod:shift,harm,nodead] Shadow Bolt; [harm,nodead] Soul Fire"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[195]},{t="anchor",id="dungeons"},{t="kicker",x=S[505]},{t="h2",x=S[352]},{t="p",x=S[51]},{t="widget",w="rarity"},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[36]},{t="p",s="notice",x=S[44]},{t="widget",w="loot"},{t="anchor",id="professions"},{t="kicker",x=S[378]},{t="h2",x=S[349]},{t="p",x=S[53]},{t="widget",w="prof"},{t="anchor",id="crafting"},{t="kicker",x=S[396]},{t="h2",x=S[330]},{t="p",x=S[28]},{t="widget",w="craft"},{t="anchor",id="questgear"},{t="kicker",x=S[379]},{t="h2",x=S[301]},{t="p",x=S[35]},{t="widget",w="quest"},{t="anchor",id=S[364]},{t="kicker",x=S[506]},{t="h2",x="Your notes"},{t="widget",w="notes"},{t="p",s="small",x=S[60]}}},{id="destruction",name="Destruction",token="DESTRO",gearBrackets={{b="Quest rewards",no="Quest rewards that fit this spec's stat priority, sorted by quest level. The tooltip names the quest, its level, the quest giver and the faction. Quest level is not the minimum pickup level.",keys={"st-warlock-3","warlock-g98","warlock-g17","warlock-g137","warlock-g52","warlock-g67","warlock-g121","warlock-g97","warlock-g4","warlock-g38","warlock-g95","warlock-g96","warlock-g23","warlock-g24","warlock-g73","warlock-g83","warlock-g140","warlock-g136","warlock-g18","warlock-g27","warlock-g76","warlock-g114","warlock-g118","warlock-g58","warlock-g89","warlock-g43","warlock-g59","warlock-g70","warlock-g113","warlock-g119","warlock-g21","warlock-g107","warlock-g13","warlock-g56","warlock-g93","warlock-g126","warlock-g20","warlock-g37","warlock-g42","warlock-g64","warlock-g127","warlock-g47","warlock-g77","warlock-g99","warlock-g101","warlock-g103","warlock-g129","warlock-g26","warlock-g28","warlock-g29","warlock-g57","warlock-g65","warlock-g80","warlock-g135","warlock-g60","warlock-g72","warlock-g78","warlock-g141","warlock-g142","warlock-g124","warlock-g10","warlock-g48","warlock-g84","warlock-g88","warlock-g90","warlock-g15","warlock-g30","warlock-g33","warlock-g63","warlock-g275","warlock-g41","warlock-g44","warlock-g49","warlock-g138","warlock-g66","warlock-g139","warlock-g82","warlock-g6","warlock-g25","warlock-g128","warlock-g16","warlock-g86","warlock-g91","warlock-g112","wa